# directives to the body's class as it parses, standalone or above a def.
# They were graded `clear`, the body read as `:nodoc:` throughout. Now the
# last own-line `:doc:` or `:nodoc:` at the def's level in a `:nodoc:`
# body decides; one in a nested body, or trailing a def, does not (DEC-657).
